# 两个分支以不同方式修改同一文件 → 冲突标记
> init
<<<
+ a.txt wug.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "c1"
<<<
> branch branch
<<<
+ a.txt notwug.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "master edit"
<<<
> checkout branch
<<<
+ a.txt other.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "branch edit"
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
> merge branch
Encountered a merge conflict.
<<<
= a.txt conflict-expected.txt
